  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72a0df9cf0ad98941a97d05eb15a1138, type: 2}
    text: Mga Amaranhig.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72a0df9cf0ad98941a97d05eb15a1138, type: 2}
    text: Mga minamahal namin na namatay ay muling nabuhay...
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72a0df9cf0ad98941a97d05eb15a1138, type: 2}
    text: At ginugulo ang nayon.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b74c278d0e28624f91a197632ab664a, type: 2}
    text: ...
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b74c278d0e28624f91a197632ab664a, type: 2}
    text: Ano'ng dapat kong gawin?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b74c278d0e28624f91a197632ab664a, type: 2}
    text: Kailangan mo munang talunin ang mga Amaranhig
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b74c278d0e28624f91a197632ab664a, type: 2}
    text: Upang mailibing namin sila ng maayos.
